{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13210080","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13210080","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1321008001:1":{"text":"감사합니다... 여러분 덕분에 훨씬 정리가 잘 됐어요.","source_cn":"谢谢你们……有你们的帮助，这里变得有条理多了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51A56EAF6E28629E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321008002:1":{"text":"휴, 고마워할 거 없어요!","source_cn":"呼，不用谢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75FA2E26EEF5781E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321008003:1":{"text":"화구 정리는 간단해 보였는데 막상 해 보니까 시간이 꽤 걸리네요.","source_cn":"整理画具听上去很简单，没想到做起来居然这么费时间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAC5873028B1B3EEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1321008004:1":{"text":"평소에 일이 많이 바빴겠네요.","source_cn":"你平时的工作也很繁重呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCFAA89E6C1A34FEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1321008005:2":{"text":"이 정도는 아무것도 아니에요...","source_cn":"这些，不算什么的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x825F789D5ADAF282","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321008006:1":{"text":"저는 미스터 티포트처럼 자작님 곁에서 오래 모신 게 아니라, 중요한 일은 맡지 못해요. 그냥 사소한 것들만 책임지고 있죠.","source_cn":"我不像茶壶先生那样，陪伴了子爵先生很多年，所以只能做一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33A0DF3B7E025732","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321008007:1":{"text":"그렇게 말하지 마세요. 루보미르 같은 예술가에겐 화구 관리가 정말 중요해요. 믿을 만한 하인이 아니면 맡길 수 없을 거예요.","source_cn":"别这样说。对于柳博米尔这样的艺术家而言，管理画具是一件...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39FF09E2597D6B43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321008008:1":{"text":"맞아요. 루보미르가 당신을 믿지 않는다면 마법을 걸어주지도 않았을 거라고요!","source_cn":"是啊，要是柳博米尔不重视你，他为什么要为你附魔呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CD8DBDCE62AA77C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321008009:1":{"text":"아마도... 제가 자작님의 부모님께서 손수 심은 침묵의 꽃이라 자작님에게 특별한 의미가 있어서 그럴 수도 있어요...","source_cn":"或许是因为……我是子爵先生父母亲手种下的永寂花，所以对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81C32576A2C6B9BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321008010:1":{"text":"아니면 마침 하인이 필요했는데 그 옆에 있던 게 저라서 선택받은 걸 수도 있고요...","source_cn":"又或者是，子爵先生刚好需要一个仆人，所以选中了在旁边的我……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9A71A8E3E0F94A06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1321008011:1":{"text":"윽, 다른 이야기 할까요?","source_cn":"呃，我们还是换个话题吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7286F99CD631ACF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321008012:1":{"text":"아, 미스터 티포트가 우리 모두에게 차를 대접하고 싶다고 했어요! 차 마시러 가요!","source_cn":"对了，要去茶壶先生那边喝杯茶吗？他刚才特地请我们邀请你去呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x91EAD18BBA56DA9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321008013:1":{"text":"미스터 티포트가 저를요...?","source_cn":"啊，茶壶先生，邀请我……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29A57CA62BCEB601","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321008014:1":{"text":"호의를 저버리면 안 되겠네요... 같이 가도록 하시지요.","source_cn":"不能辜负他的好意……我和你们一起去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5B667D486DEBE13","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:奇花侍者":{"text":"기이한 웨이터","source":"奇花侍者","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":15,"localized_text_count":14,"speaker_count":3}}